    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684760/extras/dbc10507decaa77bdbd75c9edf8e6ed9.poster.avif?t=1745423256\" width=600 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684760/extras/dbc10507decaa77bdbd75c9edf8e6ed9.webm?t=1745423256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684760/extras/dbc10507decaa77bdbd75c9edf8e6ed9.mp4?t=1745423256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Mixxpell</strong>! The battle of wizards at the International Wizard Convention. Here, you combine spells and test them out through battle with other wizards for fame and glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your deck of spell cards.\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each round, players get to choose a spell card to upgrade their build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Active spells cast magic, and support spells modify the way magic works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix them to create a unique combo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It could be something powerful to overwhelm your opponent or something more creative in a way no one ever expects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Float like a butterfly, sting like a bee.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run around unpredictably, use movement spells to dodge or close the distance, and cast a barrier if you have to block a hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And hit them with your best shot when you see the perfect opening!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 10,000 spell combinations and more to come!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local Multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Customization</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684760/extras/dbc10507decaa77bdbd75c9edf8e6ed9.poster.avif?t=1745423256\" width=600 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684760/extras/dbc10507decaa77bdbd75c9edf8e6ed9.webm?t=1745423256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684760/extras/dbc10507decaa77bdbd75c9edf8e6ed9.mp4?t=1745423256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Mixxpell</strong>! The battle of wizards at the International Wizard Convention. Here, you combine spells and test them out through battle with other wizards for fame and glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your deck of spell cards.\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each round, players get to choose a spell card to upgrade their build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Active spells cast magic, and support spells modify the way magic works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix them to create a unique combo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It could be something powerful to overwhelm your opponent or something more creative in a way no one ever expects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Float like a butterfly, sting like a bee.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run around unpredictably, use movement spells to dodge or close the distance, and cast a barrier if you have to block a hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And hit them with your best shot when you see the perfect opening!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 10,000 spell combinations and more to come!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local Multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Customization</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Mixxpell is a 1v1 wizard fighting game full of flashy spells and fast-paced fun. Create a powerful combination of magic to overpower the opponent, or a clever build to mess with them. Dodge and weave around your opponent's magic and dance on their grave for emotional damage!",
